<title>DUBAI: Sharjah air cargo volumes climb 31 percent in May.</title>
<headline>Sharjah air cargo volumes climb 31 percent in May.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sharjah airport said cargo volumes rose 31 percent in May to 30,625 tonnes from 23,377 tonnes in the same month last year.</p>
<p>Sea-air freight exports rose to 3,143 tonnes from 3,021 tonnes in May 1996.</p>
<p>May's overall cargo figure was lower than the 34,360 tonnes handled in April this year. - Dubai newsroom +9714-626990</p>
<p>www.racs.com</p>
